  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceans_header.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"549\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您熱愛海洋，這個專為《Loading Backgrounds》模組打造的附加資源包非常適合您！它將標準的載入畫面替換為令人驚嘆的海洋圖像——從水生生物、水下遺跡到深海威脅，應有盡有。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loading-backgrounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loading Backgrounds</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一個伺服器來和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找一個可以和朋友一起玩任何模組或模組包的伺服器，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 是您的首選！他們提供品質與價格最優的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享受 25% 折扣。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds/BH_LB_banner1.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>這個資源包在伺服器上能用嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！它運作得非常完美！請記住，與朋友一起玩模組的最佳方式就是透過 BisectHosting，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</a>.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個資源包可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要它僅發佈於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 即可。上傳到任何其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，完全不被允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包中，我們會非常感激。如果您需要任何微調或有任何疑問，歡迎聯絡我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製這個模組的影片並在我的頻道上展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您可以自由地在您的頻道上遊玩這個模組或我們的任何模組包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感謝您的分享！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot1.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot2.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceansscreenshot3.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Loading_Backgrounds_Resourcepacks/MP_LoadingBackgrounds_Oceans_screenshot4.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"1089\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
